16. CUSTOM JAR – COPY/PASTE PATTERN
------------------------------------
mvn install:install-file ^
-Dfile=library.jar ^
-DgroupId=com.example ^
-DartifactId=library ^
-Dversion=1.0.0 ^
-Dpackaging=jar

Then add it to pom.xml:

<dependency>
    <groupId>com.example</groupId>
    <artifactId>library</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.0</version>
</dependency>


